<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>Aspire Leadership Dashboard</title><script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js"></script><style>:root{--primary:#0067b8;--secondary:#00a4ef;--bg:#f4f7fb;--card:#fff;--text:#222}[data-theme=dark]{--bg:#111827;--card:#1f2937;--text:#f3f4f6}*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Segoe UI,sans-serif}body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--text)}header{padding:30px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0067b8,#00a4ef);color:#fff}.container{padding:30px}.kpi-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:20px;margin:20px 0}.kpi,.section{background:var(--card);padding:24px;border-radius:18px;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}.kpi h2{color:#0067b8;font-size:2.4rem}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px}button{padding:10px 15px;border:none;border-radius:10px;cursor:pointer}@media(max-width:900px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style></head><body><header><h1>Aspire Leadership Development Programme</h1><p>Executive Insights Dashboard</p><br><button onclick="document.body.dataset.theme=document.body.dataset.theme==='dark'?'':'dark'">Toggle Dark Mode</button></header><div class="container"><div class="kpi-grid"><div class="kpi"><h2>92%</h2><p>High Relevance Rating</p></div><div class="kpi"><h2>95%</h2><p>Ready To Apply Learning</p></div><div class="kpi"><h2>4.8</h2><p>Faculty Rating</p></div><div class="kpi"><h2>87%</h2><p>Leadership Confidence Increase</p></div></div><div class="grid"><div class="section"><h2>Programme Effectiveness</h2><canvas id="effectiveness"></canvas></div><div class="section"><h2>Most Valuable Topics</h2><canvas id="topics"></canvas></div><div class="section"><h2>Future Learning Requests</h2><canvas id="future"></canvas></div><div class="section"><h2>Executive Summary</h2><ul><li>Coaching and feedback skills were most valued.</li><li>Networking and self-reflection delivered strong impact.</li><li>Participants requested stakeholder management and change leadership.</li></ul></div></div></div><script>new Chart(document.getElementById('effectiveness'),{type:'radar',data:{labels:['Relevance','Quality','Application','Engagement','Faculty','Experience'],datasets:[{data:[92,95,94,90,96,93],borderColor:'#0067b8',backgroundColor:'rgba(0,103,184,.2)'}]}});new Chart(document.getElementById('topics'),{type:'bar',data:{labels:['Coaching','Feedback','Self Reflection','Networking','Resilience'],datasets:[{data:[95,90,88,81,72],backgroundColor:'#0067b8'}]}});new Chart(document.getElementById('future'),{type:'bar',data:{labels:['Stakeholder Mgmt','Change Leadership','Difficult Conversations','Resilience'],datasets:[{data:[88,84,79,73],backgroundColor:'#00a4ef'}]},options:{indexAxis:'y'}});</script></body></html>
